  "solution": {
    "text": "If this loop is close net force on it will be zero<br />so F + F<sub>straight</sub> = 0<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>⇒&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo> <mtext>F</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mo>-</mo> <msub> <mtext>F</mtext> <mtext>straight</mtext> </msub> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mtext>F</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>I</mtext> <msqrt> <mn>2</mn> </msqrt> <mtext>RB</mtext> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mtext>F</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <msqrt> <mn>2</mn> </msqrt> <mo>IRB</mo> </mrow> </math><br /><br /> <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0032942_Ans.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 225px; height: 145px;\" />",
